    {
      "parameters": {
        "sendTo": "={{ $('Normalize Intake Data').item.json.email }}",
        "subject": "Your Case Evaluation Request – Mitchell & Chen Solicitors",
        "message": "=<p>Dear {{ $('Normalize Intake Data').first().json.full_name }},</p>  <p>Thank you for contacting Mitchell & Chen Solicitors and for taking the time to share the details of your situation.</p>  <p>After reviewing your request, we regret to inform you that our firm is unable to represent you in this matter. This decision is not an opinion on the merits of your case.</p>  <p>Please be aware that legal claims are subject to strict time limits, known as limitation periods. We strongly encourage you to seek advice from another solicitor as soon as possible to protect your rights. You can find a qualified solicitor using the Law Society's Find a Solicitor service.</p>  <p>We wish you the best in resolving this matter.</p>  <p>Sincerely,<br> Client Intake Team<br> Mitchell & Chen Solicitors</p>  <p style=\"font-size:12px;color:#777;\">This message does not create a solicitor-client relationship and does not constitute legal advice.</p>",
        "options": {
          "appendAttribution": false
        }
      },
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.gmail",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [
        2528,
        384
      ],
